# The only image built from this repository is the repeater server's
# (`docker build -f repeater/server/Dockerfile .`). An allowlist, so the context never carries
# node_modules, every target/ or the app. The root Cargo workspace files join it with PR B
# (docs/MONOREPO.md).
*
!repeater/protocol/
!repeater/server/Cargo.toml
!repeater/server/Cargo.lock
!repeater/server/src/
**/target/
